            ],
            "rationale": "The search matching (Catalog.searchBooks) and the on-shelf rule (Catalog.isOnShelf, 'not on loan') are in Tier 2, and Views calls them. The Tier 3 bookCopies view also decides on its own whether a copy is on loan, by looking in library.Loans, instead of asking Tier 2. This repeats part of the isOnShelf rule and does not contradict it.",
            "score": 1
