              }
            ],
            "rationale": "Whether a copy is on loan is defined in Catalog.isOnShelf. It is restated in Views.bookCopies as a lookup in Loans. The two agree. The 'copy is on shelf' fact therefore has two expressions, with a small risk of drift.",
