            "rationale": "The ISBN match (Catalog.searchBooks), the branch copy selection (Catalog.copiesOfAt) and branch validation (Catalog.findBranch) are in Tier 2. The F1 rule 'list only books with at least one copy at the branch' is decided in the Tier 3 Views.search filter, as a local special case. It agrees with the requirement and is not decided differently elsewhere. The earlier DueBack loan lookup is untouched by this change set.",
